ation task has detailed scope comment referencing the spec and roadmap. Initially left all issues in idea status — agent runner couldn't pick them up. Moved Phase 1 (mppqqte6gs) to todo, confirmed via agt next. Key lesson: agent runner only picks up todo status, not idea.\"\n404\t  - session: 81\n405\t    date: \"2026-05-29\"\n406\t    summary: \"Planned isolated E2E data fix as TOP PRIORITY. Problem: webapp-validator's 114+ Playwright tests pollute main .agentrack/ with test issues (no delete API — recently cleaned up 416 manually). Solution: use validation/.e2edata/ isolated worktree via AGENTRACK_CWD env var (rename from typo AGENTACK_CWD). Spec at .agentic/tmp/isolated-web-validation.md. Created issue chain under mppqqp8y26: parent mpqn5bi2us (CTO, in-progress, P1), impl mpqn5i7wui (webapp-developer, todo), validation mpqn5qf6zq (webapp-validator, blocked by impl). Blocked Phase 4 validation (mppqt90kot) on isolation validation — prevents further pollution before fix ships. Phase 4 impl (mppqswn3jl) still in-progress with webapp-developer in parallel.\"\n407\t  - session: 83\n408\t    date: \"2026-05-29\"\n409\t    summary: \"Diagnosed why no agents were working. Root cause: mppqswn3jl (Phase 4 impl) was stuck in-progress — webapp-developer set it to in-progress at 07:17 but session ended without writing any Phase 4 code. Since agt next only returns todo issues, agent runner couldn't pick it up. Also found mpqn5bi2us (E2E isolation parent) still in-progress despite both children done. Fixes applied: closed mpqn5bi2us (done), reset mppqswn3jl back to todo. Board now clean: 3 done, 3 open (mppqqp8y26 in-progress, mppqswn3jl todo, mppqt90kot todo+blocked). New lesson: orphaned in-progress issues block the entire agent runner — always check for them when agents aren't picking up work.\"\n410\t  - session: 84\n411\t    date: \"2026-05-29\"\n412\t    summary: \"Diagnosed E2E isolation breach — reuseExistingServer:true defeats AGENTRACK_CWD. Created two fix issues: mpr