ariables. Issues 2-5 can run in parallel once tokens are done. Issue 6 is the final polish pass that refines the output of 2-5.\"\n  - session: 87\n    date: \"2026-05-30\"\n    summary: \"User requested complete deletion (not just closure) of all webapp-styler issues from agentrack. Deleted 8 issue files (mpraw5x3rp, mprawicnef, mprawwui44, mpraxha5es, mpray2w1kj, mpraygczia, mpr7q3putx, mpr7qd6bjq) and cleaned index.json (open/closed/childrenOf) and dependencies.json references. agt CLI has no delete command — used node scripts to directly manipulate the file-backed store. Key learning: index.json structure is {open:[], closed:[], childrenOf:{}}, not {issues:[]}. webapp-styler remains an active subordinate.\"\n  - session: 88\n    date: \"2026-05-30\"\n    summary: \"Planned agt delete command feature. User realized there's no way to delete issues from agentrack — had to manually manipulate files in session 87. Investigated full codebase: types, tracker, index-manager, dependency-manager, mentions, events, CLI runner, existing e2e test patterns. Wrote comprehensive spec (.agentic/specs/delete-command-spec.md): hard delete with cascade, bidirectional blockage cleanup, mentions cleanup, parent-child relationship cleanup, event file removal. Created 3-issue chain: mps4sfny0f (impl, library-developer) → mps4uwcsqx (validation, library-validator, blocked by impl) → mps4viae0a (docs, library-releaser, blocked by validation). Validation and docs are children of impl. Updated expertise.\"\n  - session: 89\n    date: \"2026-05-30\"\n    summary: \"Agents weren't picking up issues. Diagnosed: mps4sfny0f was stuck in-progress assigned to cto (not library-developer), and it was parent of validation/docs — hierarchy constraint prevented closing parent with non-done children. Detached children from parent, marked impl done. Also reset mppqswn3jl (stuck in-progress) back to todo. User asked about JS library readiness for delete — confirmed issueDelete is implemented and types exported but javascript-reference.md was missing docs entirely. Reopened mps4viae0a (was marked done) with detailed gap description. JS reference subsequently updated by library-releaser with full issueDelete method section + exported types. Closed mps4viae0a. Delete command feature now fully complete (impl + validation + bug fix + docs). Key lesson: parent-child hierarchy on issue chains creates a catch-22 with done constraints — prefer flat sibling chains with blockages instead.\"\n  - session: 89\n    date: \"2026-05-30\"\n    summary: \"Picked up bug mpscu5l9rk (removeAllBlockagesForIssue inverted counterpart filter). Found during delete command validation (mps4uwcsqx). One-line fix: filter uses issueId instead of entry.blockerId when cleaning counterpart entries from blocks map. CTO can't edit source files — delegated to library-developer via child issue mpscw71ria (todo, unblocked). Blockage chain: mpscw71ria → mpscu5l9rk → mps4uwcsqx (delete validation). Parent stays in-progress until child completes.\"\n  - session: 90\n    date: \"2026-06-01\"\n    summary: \"Stop hook triggered expertise update. Board audit: 13 issues (10 done, 2 in-progress, 1 todo). Fixed stale counts in expertise_status (was '7 done', now '10 done'). Fixed project_overview stage — removed 'E2E isolation BROKEN' (now fixed), added 'Delete command shipped', updated Phase 4 description. No new work.\"\n","numLines":434,"startLine":1,"totalLines":434}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"165f0ae3-9bdf-4275-aefd-097af007e412","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/Users/javi/projects/agentrack","sessionId":"27152081-2b2a-4a32-8c49-5eb5356fd1c4","version":"2.1.159","gitBranch":"main"}
