NG, TOKEN_REQUIRED\n124\t  phase_5_results:\n125\t    tests: 284 passing, 1101 assertions, 99.31% coverage (99.77% functions, 99.31% lines)\n126\t    typecheck: clean (strict + 4 extra flags)\n127\t    lint: clean (ESLint, zero errors)\n128\t    format: clean (Prettier, zero issues)\n129\t    docs_check: clean (TypeDoc parses all source)\n130\t    coverage_by_file:\n131\t      hierarchy.ts: 100%/100%\n132\t      index-manager.ts: 100%/100%\n133\t      tracker.ts: 97.96%/100% (Bun coverage artifact)\n134\t      auth.ts: 100%/100%\n135\t      errors.ts: 100%/100%\n136\t      events.ts: 100%/100%\n137\t      file-io.ts: 100%/100%\n138\t      id.ts: 100%/100%\n139\t      resolution.ts: 100%/93.75% (V8 artifact)\n140\t    new_files:\n141\t      core: hierarchy.ts (isStatusAfter, validateNewChild, validateParentStatusChange, getClosableChildren, computeUpwardPromotions)\n142\t      tests: tests/core/hierarchy.test.ts (22 tests)\n143\t    modified_files:\n144\t      core: index-manager.ts (added addChild, removeChild, getChildren), tracker.ts (hierarchy integration in create + update with downward cascade, upward auto-promotion, reparenting)\n145\t      tests: index-manager.test.ts (+10 tests), tracker.test.ts (+17 tests), commands.test.ts (fixed parent IDs + CLI hierarchy tests)\n146\t    quality_additions:\n147\t      tests_added_by_quality: 12 additional tests (auth integration for hierarchy ops, CLI --parentId tests, edge cases: same status no-op, reparent from null, same parentId no-op, done parent allowed, mixed cascade, already-closed children)\n148\t      total_new_tests_phase5: 68 (56 by developer + 12 by quality)\n149\t    design_decisions:\n150\t      - hierarchy.ts is a pure function module — no I/O, no side effects, easily testable\n151\t      - System-authored events use author \"system\" with reason field explaining the trigger\n152\t      - Downward cascade (auto-close) is recursive through the subtree\n153\t      - Upward promotion is recursive through ancestors\n154\t      - Only closed parents block new children (done/idea/etc. are allowed)\n155\t      - HIERARCHY_CONSTRAINT (exit code 12) prevents the operation entirely — no partial state changes\n156\t  phase_6_results:\n157\t    status: quality_validated\n158\t    typecheck: clean (strict + 4 extra flags)\n159\t    lint: clean (ESLint, zero errors)\n160\t    format: clean (Prettier, zero issues)\n161\t    docs_check: clean (TypeDoc parses all source)\n162\t    new_files:\n163\t      core: dependency-manager.ts (readDependencies, writeDependencies, addBlockage, resolveBlockage, deleteBlockage, getImpactScore, detectCycle)\n164\t      cli: commands/blockages.ts (add/resolve/delete/list subcommands)\n165\t      tests: tests/core/dependency-manager.test.ts\n166\t    modified_files:\n167\t      core: tracker.ts (4 blockage methods + auto-resolution on done/closed + impact score in list sort), events.ts\n168\t      cli: runner.ts (registered blockages subcommand)\n169\t      tests: tracker.test.ts (blockage tests), commands.test.ts (CLI blockage tests)\n170\t    design_decisions:\n171\t      - Cycle detection walks blockedBy graph transitively from proposed blocker, only active entries\n172\t      - Batch add validates against projected state — all cycle checks pass before any write (atomic)\n173\t      - Auto-resolution fires on done/closed transition — resolves active blocks entries with system-authored events\n174\t      - Impact score counts active blocks entries — used in list sort (priority ASC → impact DESC → id ASC)\n175\t      - BLOCKAGE_CYCLE error (exit code 11) prevents operation entirely, no partial state changes\n176\t    spec: .agentic/specs/07-phase6-blockages-spec.md\n177\t  last_updated: \"2026-05-30\"\n178\t  org_change:\n179\t    description: \"library-releaser agent onboarded. Documentation responsibility transferred from library-validator to library-releaser. webapp-styler onboarded for UI/UX.\"\n180\t    issues: [mpa5yz3kei, mpr7q3putx]\n181\t  